controls.description:
Mechanisms exist to develop and maintain a Cryptographic Bill of Materials (CBOM) by analyzing the organization's cryptographic architecture, including:
(1) Hardware;
(2) Firmware;
(3) Software modules; and
(4) Communication protocols.

